// What the model gives, written by `BLESS=1` (design/19-cases.md).
run 1: Readings { visibility: ByMember, deferral: Recording }, every order
outcome 1
  accepted
  value 0: u8
  value X: u8
  value f: Fn/0
  value `f()`: ()
  value `takes_u8(x)`: ()
  value `|| ..`: Fn/0
  value `λ result`: ()
  decision `f()`: calls {λ}
  decision takes_u8: takes_u8#0
  partition {0, X}
  check `0 <= X`: Ok(Identity)
  check `X ~> takes_u8.Param(0)`: Ok(Identity)
  check `takes_u8(x) <= λ result`: Ok(Identity)
  check `takes_u8.Result <= takes_u8(x)`: Ok(Identity)
  check `|| .. <= f`: Ok(Identity)
  check `λ result <= f()`: Ok(Identity)
  I* of a final state: []
